  "description": {
   "en": "\"In order to get up on stage, you need to be special.\"\n\nHikaru Ogino spends her days singing oldies in her family's bath house, but when her best friend Ran — a former idol — invites her to try out for an \"idol survival camp\" together, it'll put her talents to the test. Can Hikaru outshine the competition and make her stage debut, or will she fall flat? Witness the birth of a new star in this exciting story about chasing your dreams!\n___\nLicensed in English by Azuki, Full color print edition collab with Scholastic Graphix: [Link](https://shop.scholastic.com/parent-ecommerce/books/hikaru-in-the-light-volume-1-9781546140986.html) | [ANN](https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/press-release/2024-08-23/azuki-to-publish-two-series-with-scholastic-graphix-and-add-four-new-manga-series/.214682)",
   "ja": "銭湯の娘・荻野ひかるは歌うことが大好きな中学三年生。幼馴染の西川 蘭は、大所帯グループ「JP学園」でアイドルをしている自慢の友達。そんな中、世界的プロデューサー、M・葉山による一大オーディション「ガールズ・イン・ザ・ライト」が始まり…!?"
  },
